eletion diagnostics.\n\n### 5. manipulation-positioning (Related Work, medium)\n- `adversarial vote manipulation of LLM arena leaderboard rankings`, category `result_driven_theme`.\n- The budget is motivated through deliberate action and rigging, yet the \"Scope of the bibliography\" paragraph disclaims positioning against that work.\n\n### 6. manipulation-positioning (Related Work, medium)\n- `robustness of rankings from pairwise comparisons to adversarial or corrupted comparisons`, category `baseline_comparator`.\n- One or two general comparator citations would replace the disclaimer.\n\n## Not targeted\nBT extensions, estimation and uncertainty related work. The gap memo says more citations there would only grow the bibliography. Numeric claims are grounded in `paper_data.json`. No Elo or sports queries are added because the gap artifact does not flag them.\n\nI added three claims to `claims_grounding.json`, so it now has 28, each tied to its provenance id and citation key. `validate_tex_refs.py` and `validate_claims.py` pass. The scientific-evidence verifier reports 0 dangling references.\n\nI also added a `\\label{lastbodypage}` before the bibliography to read off the last body page. It is harmless to the layout. I logged the changes in `memory.md` and `global_memory/memory.md`.\n{\"usage\":{\"agent\":\"claude\",\"provider\":\"anthropic\",\"model\":\"claude-sonnet-5-5\",\"inputTokens\":42,\"cacheReadTokens\":1495419,\"cacheWriteTokens\":72499,\"outputTokens\":9016,\"reasoningOutputTokens\":0,\"totalTokens\":1576976,\"usageStatus\":\"reported\",\"cost\":{\"input\":null,\"cacheRead\":null,\"cacheWrite\":null,\"output\":null,\"total\":0.6793238},\"costBasis\":\"native-reported\",\"pricingSource\":\"native\",\"pricingStatus\":\"","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
