ter count or word density. Do not claim that page validation passed using a character-count proxy. If the canonical validator is unavailable in the agent workspace, make the targeted repair and return control so the parent can compile and revalidate it.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
